Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:59.70,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:05.52,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:11.69,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.87,0:01:14.72,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:17.24,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:21.01,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:23.82,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:24.32,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:27.12,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就选你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:29.83,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:30.12,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:32.84,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.38,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:38.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小猫轻咬般你侬我侬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:43.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}这么直到永远就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:46.99,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我们认真起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.63,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}心痛是在所难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.98,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.95,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\3c&579BE3&\blur4\t(0,1900,\3c&55BA79&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:55.40,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4\t(0,2500,\3c&C777C3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
